<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 483 0 R
/ActualText (Context API: The TabsContext is created using React's createContext\(\) function. This context is used to pass down the activeIndex \(the current active tab\) and the selectTabIndex function \(which allows changing the active tab\) to the child components without needing to pass them manually as props.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
